<span>ONDO TOWN • EDUCATION</span>
<h3>Wesley University Ondo Town Graduates 742 Students, 79 Bag First-Class!</h3>
<p><b>By Threedex News | Ondo Town | 21 November 2026</b></p>
<p>Big celebration for Ondo Town as Wesley University, Ondo Town don graduate total of 742 students for im 15th convocation ceremony.</p>
<p>Out of the number, 434 na undergraduate students, while 308 na postgraduate students. For undergraduate, 79 students bag First Class, 283 get Second Class Upper, 71 get Second Class Lower and 1 get Third Class.</p>
<p>The Vice-Chancellor, Prof. Samuel Obeka, talk this one on Friday as e dey announce activities for the convocation wey happen on Saturday.</p>
<p>Congratulations to all the graduates of Wesley University, Ondo Town!</p>
<p><b>Source: Punch Newspaper</b></p>
