<h3>Osimhen Back To Training! Super Eagles Rise To 29th In FIFA Ranking</h3>
<p><b>By Threedex News | 21 November 2026</b></p>
<p>Good news for Super Eagles fans! Victor Osimhen don return to club training after injury, alongside Frank Onyeka.</p>
<p>Also, Super Eagles don rise one place to 29th in the world for latest FIFA Ranking, and 5th for Africa.</p>
<p>Nigeria now get 7 points for Group L, 3 points behind Guinea-Bissau. Eagles must win their last two matches in March 2027 against Madagascar and Guinea-Bissau to qualify for AFCON 2027.</p>
<p><b>Source: Punch / FIFA</b></p>
